  <h2>7. CONCLUSION</h2>
  <p>
    The Inventory and Billing Management System provides a practical and reliable solution for small to medium retail operations. It combines product management, billing, and analytics in one interface and protects stock integrity through transactional checkout logic.
  </p>
  <p>
    The project also demonstrates a resilient design approach by including a sandbox fallback when live database connectivity is unavailable. This makes the application suitable for demos, testing, and everyday operational use.
  </p>
  <p>
    Overall, the system successfully achieves the goal of improving retail workflow efficiency, stock visibility, and billing accuracy.
  </p>

